<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Autonomous on Best of AI</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tags/autonomous/</link><description>Recent content in Autonomous on Best of AI</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-US</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://bestofai.io/tags/autonomous/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Viktor</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/viktor-ai/</link><pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/viktor-ai/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Viktor is an AI agent from Zeta Labs that lives inside Slack and Microsoft Teams instead of a standalone interface. It connects to a company&amp;rsquo;s existing tools, learns the patterns of how a team works over time, and steps in with suggestions or completed work such as campaign drafts, internal apps, and reports, without waiting for someone to open a separate app.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zeta Labs, the team behind the earlier AI email assistant Jace, launched Viktor on Slack first and expanded it to Microsoft Teams in mid-2026. The company says tens of thousands of teams have adopted it, and it has raised a $75 million Series A led by Accel. Viktor targets teams that want an AI agent that acts inside the channels where work already happens rather than one more tool to switch into.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>DeepSeek Harness</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/deepseek-harness/</link><pubDate>Mon, 17 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/deepseek-harness/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Comet</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/perplexity-comet/</link><pubDate>Wed, 29 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/perplexity-comet/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Genspark</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/genspark/</link><pubDate>Wed, 29 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/genspark/</guid><description/></item><item><title>OpenAI Presence</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/openai-presence/</link><pubDate>Wed, 22 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/openai-presence/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Baidu Qianfan</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/baidu-qianfan/</link><pubDate>Fri, 17 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/baidu-qianfan/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Cohere North</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/cohere-north/</link><pubDate>Fri, 17 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/cohere-north/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Palantir AIP</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/palantir-aip/</link><pubDate>Fri, 17 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/palantir-aip/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Tencent Cloud ADP</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/tencent-cloud-adp/</l